   <conbody>
      <p>When you select the "<i>Enable File</i>" comply system property in Conga CLM, you can check in, check out, and work on the agreement documents of type - Files. For more information, see 
<xref href="https://documentation.conga.com/clm/latest/salesforce/comply-system-properties-247532844.html" format="html" scope="external">Comply System Properties.</xref>
      </p>
